_:b62 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> "That is, if the terms $a_{n}$ of a series $\\sum a_{n}$ do not tend to zero, then the series must diverge." .
_:b62 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#nil> .
