_:b63 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#nil> .
_:b64 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> "This is called the nth partial sum of the series." .
