_:b65 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> "Such a function $f$ is called a permutation of $\\mathbf{P}$ , or a one-to-one mapping of $\\mathbf{P}$ onto itself." .
_:b65 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#nil> .
