_:b73 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> "THEOREM 10.13. RATIO TEST. Let $\\sum a_{n}$ be a series of positive terms such that" .
_:b73 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> _:b74 .
_:b74 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> "Warning. If the test ratio $a_{n+1}/a_{n}$ is always less than 1, it does not necessarily follow that the limit L will be less than 1." .
